<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Featherbed-Lane.jpg" alt="This large landscape features dense textures of grass in the foreground, a stream, and distant treeline." width="450" height="547" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Featherbed Lane. 24x20, oil on linen. 2014.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Although I've been planning this painting for a long time, the actual painting part went very quickly: I started this last weekend and, after letting it dry for a week, I did the finishing touches today.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In preparation, I did a few pencil scribbles, followed by a fairly decent sized <a title="Link to the original study" href="/blog/Study-for-Featherbed-Lane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">study</a>, I started the final painting with a&nbsp;transparent monochrome block in and let it dry before proceeding with the final layers.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This painting will be headed for The Cooley Gallery at the end of August.</p>